WEBVTT

00:09:58.436 --> 00:10:01.236
For me, the fact
that I'm financially well off

00:10:01.236 --> 00:10:03.916
doesn't make up for the fact
that I'm killing the planet.

00:10:04.516 --> 00:10:06.476
It wasn't this realization, though,

00:10:06.476 --> 00:10:09.156
that got me thinking
something had to change.

00:10:09.196 --> 00:10:11.356
Shortly after my sister passed away,

00:10:11.396 --> 00:10:13.636
I did this exercise on her behalf.

00:10:13.996 --> 00:10:15.356
And it got me thinking.

00:10:16.116 --> 00:10:19.036
For Productivity and Profit,
she was a zero.

00:10:19.076 --> 00:10:20.756
She struggled financially.

00:10:20.796 --> 00:10:22.796
In her final few years she couldn't work,

00:10:22.796 --> 00:10:24.236
but she got by.

00:10:24.756 --> 00:10:26.996
For People, she was a definite one.

00:10:27.036 --> 00:10:29.036
She really knew her own identity.

00:10:29.036 --> 00:10:30.316
She invested in her life.